      <title>Dixon’s Oliver’s Corner Market owners getting ready to close, retire after 39 years in business</title>
      <link>https://www.shawlocal.com/sauk-valley/2026/03/24/dixons-olivers-corner-market-owners-getting-ready-to-close-retire-after-39-years-in-business/</link>
      <description>The owners of Dixon’s family owned grocery store, Oliver’s Corner Market, started placing items on sale Monday as they prepare to close after 39 years in operation. The store will close when the remaining inventory runs out, by April 4 at the latest.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.shawlocal.com/sauk-valley/2026/03/24/dixons-olivers-corner-market-owners-getting-ready-to-close-retire-after-39-years-in-business/</guid>
